<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're really strong!
You surprised me!</font>

106
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:44,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's my line. You're one tough guy!</font>

107
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:47,880
