112
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

113
00:10:59,060 --> 00:11:03,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Match level?
- What do you suppose that means?</font>

114
00:11:03,290 --> 00:11:07,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But it looks like you wanna kill me,</font>

115
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:09,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">so I'll fight at "battle level" now!</font>

116
00:11:09,770 --> 00:11:12,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Battle level?</font>

117
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:15,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So <i>now</i> you're going to
