119
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:21,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here I come! Battle start!</font>

120
00:11:21,780 --> 00:11:24,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm looking forward to it! Bring it on!</font>

121
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:52,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Ka...</i></font>

122
00:11:52,710 --> 00:11:54,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>me</i>...</font>

123
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:57,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>...</font>

124
00:11:58,610 --> 00:12:01,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>me</i>...</font>

125
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:07,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Never mind!</font>

126
00:12:17,810 --> 00:12:20,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I bet you felt that, huh?</font>

127
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:30,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm happy that someone like you exists!</font>

128
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:35,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is the first time I've been so excited!</font>

129
00:12:37,310 --> 00:12:41,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You really are amazing!
That makes me glad!</font>

130
00:12:41,050 --> 00:12:45,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The title will be mine! Prepare yourself!</font>

131
00:12:45,990 --> 00:12:47,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, no, it won't!</font>

132
00:12:47,890 --> 00:12:52,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku's so stupid...
why did he stop his <i>Kamehameha</i>?</font>

133
00:12:52,890 --> 00:12:55,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He saw ahead.</font>

134
00:12:55,390 --> 00:12:58,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If Goku had fired the
<i>Kamehameha</i> at that point in time,</font>

135
00:12:58,900 --> 00:13:01,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">there is no doubt it would
have been deflected!</font>

136
00:13:03,570 --> 00:13:07,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He would have only
succeeded in wasting energy.</font>

137
00:13:07,470 --> 00:13:10,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The fight will be a long one.</font>

138
00:13:10,070 --> 00:13:14,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku actually calculated in advance!</font>

139
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:03,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What an incredible display
