141
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:20,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's it, Son-<i>kun</i>! Knock him out!</font>

142
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:24,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, my! Tenshinhan doesn't
