143
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:28,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son continues with his intense assault!</font>

144
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:51,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come on, Son-<i>kun</i>!</font>

145
00:14:53,940 --> 00:14:55,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Too bad!</font>

146
00:14:55,310 --> 00:14:57,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The tables have been turned!</font>

147
00:14:57,310 --> 00:15:03,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now Tenshinhan is driving Son into
