148
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:28,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fool!</font>

149
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:33,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can't trick me with the <i>Zanzouken</i>!</font>

150
00:15:33,190 --> 00:15:34,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're above me!</font>

151
00:15:36,820 --> 00:15:38,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

152
00:15:38,460 --> 00:15:40,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Too bad!</font>

153
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:46,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You fell for your own trick!</font>

154
00:15:51,500 --> 00:15:53,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ten-<i>san</i>!</font>

155
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:02,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He did it!</font>

156
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:04,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm not sure how it happened,</font>

157
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:09,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but Son's powerful kick connected
with Tenshinhan's head!</font>

158
00:16:12,450 --> 00:16:15,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You fell for the same trick, too!</font>

159
00:16:24,660 --> 00:16:27,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why, you!</font>

160
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:32,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You didn't faint?! You're tough!</font>

161
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:36,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come on! He got up again!</font>

162
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:38,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Impressive!</font>

163
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:42,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is the first time in my life</font>

164
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:44,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've been put in a situation like this!</font>

165
00:16:44,250 --> 00:16:48,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How dare you shame me?</font>

166
00:16:48,420 --> 00:16:52,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm all sweaty, too, you know...</font>

167
00:16:52,090 --> 00:16:54,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Playtime is over!</font>

168
00:16:54,420 --> 00:16:57,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm going to put an end to this match!</font>

169
00:16:57,190 --> 00:16:59,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here it comes!</font>

170
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:01,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Taiyouken</i>!</font>

171
00:17:19,790 --> 00:17:23,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He did it again!</font>

172
00:17:50,010 --> 00:17:53,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How?</font>

173
00:18:00,290 --> 00:18:01,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sunglasses!</font>

174
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:08,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where did you... get those?</font>

175
00:18:08,630 --> 00:18:10,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I borrowed them!</font>

176
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:18,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tenshinhan is down!</font>

177
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:21,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

178
00:18:21,310 --> 00:18:23,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">When did he...</font>

179
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- One!
- That was amazing!</font>

180
00:18:28,820 --> 00:18:32,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Two! Three!
- What kind of attack
do you think Goku did?</font>

181
00:18:32,450 --> 00:18:35,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- How should I know?
- Four!</font>

182
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:38,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Old-Timer Turtle Hermit! Thank you!
- Five!</font>

183
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- You were fast.
- Six!</font>

184
00:18:39,810 --> 00:18:42,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Excellent thinking, I might add.
- Seven!</font>

185
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:54,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku!</font>

186
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn it!</font>

187
00:18:56,170 --> 00:18:58,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow!</font>

188
00:18:58,340 --> 00:19:01,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You really are tough!</font>

189
00:19:01,340 --> 00:19:03,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't show off!</font>

190
00:19:03,340 --> 00:19:07,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You knocked me down only
because I let my guard down!</font>

191
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:10,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My sunglasses!</font>

192
00:19:13,210 --> 00:19:15,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>That impertinent brat!</i></font>

193
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:25,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Damn it!</i></font>

194
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:34,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then I'll knock you down for real this time!</font>

195
00:19:34,340 --> 00:19:37,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't you dare mock me, runt!</font>

196
00:19:47,190 --> 00:19:52,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is the first time I've seen
you without your sunglasses on!</font>

197
00:19:52,290 --> 00:19:55,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really?</font>

198
00:19:55,330 --> 00:20:02,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I get the feeling I've seen
your eyes somewhere before...</font>

199
00:20:04,140 --> 00:20:07,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They're very common eyes!</font>

200
00:20:07,470 --> 00:20:11,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I could swear that...</font>

201
00:20:11,450 --> 00:20:14,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is no time for petty conversation!</font>

202
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:16,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Watch the match!</font>

203
00:20:16,620 --> 00:20:18,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right!</font>

204
00:20:27,330 --> 00:20:29,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You left yourself open!</font>

205
00:20:43,380 --> 00:20:45,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That wasn't fair!</font>

206
00:20:45,620 --> 00:20:47,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

207
00:20:51,780 --> 00:20:55,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Darn it! That was dirty!</font>

208
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:57,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What? Dirty?!</font>

209
00:20:57,880 --> 00:21:01,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What nonsense are you spouting now?!</font>

210
00:21:02,350 --> 00:21:05,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's the matter with Goku?</font>

211
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:09,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Could it be...?</i></font>

212
00:21:09,020 --> 00:21:11,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Quit your complaining!</font>

213
00:21:11,460 --> 00:21:13,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Die!</font>

214
00:21:13,030 --> 00:21:15,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Try that again, if you dare!</font>

215
00:21:45,520 --> 00:21:49,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Do it, Chaozu.
- R-Right!</font>

216
00:21:59,810 --> 00:22:04,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son is going to fall outside the ring!</font>

217
00:22:04,180 --> 00:22:06,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is the match over?!</font>

218
00:22:09,550 --> 00:22:11,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's falling!</font>

219
00:22:15,390 --> 00:22:17,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kame...</i></font>

220
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>hame</i>...</font>

221
00:22:18,730 --> 00:22:20,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>!</font>

222
00:22:31,910 --> 00:22:35,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son has narrowly escaped a ring out!</font>

223
00:22:47,560 --> 00:22:49,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do it!</font>

224
00:23:11,470 --> 00:23:17,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">After suddenly faring poorly,
Son is finally down!</font>

225
00:23:17,830 --> 00:23:20,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I thought so!</i></font>

226
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:22,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>That dirty old Crane Hermit!</i></font>

227
00:23:38,520 --> 00:23:40,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's all over.</font>

228
00:23:47,280 --> 00:23:48,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can't be serious!</font>

229
00:23:49,980 --> 00:23:52,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get up! Get up, Goku!</font>

230
00:23:52,590 --> 00:24:00,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">One! Two! Three!</font>

231
00:24:00,220 --> 00:24:02,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now! Kill him!</font>

232
00:24:02,810 --> 00:24:05,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kill him, Ten!</font>

233
00:24:08,320 --> 00:24:11,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I see. So that's what's going on.</i></font>

234
00:24:13,520 --> 00:24:18,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Chaozu! Was this your doing?!</font>

235
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-Yes...</font>

236
00:24:19,990 --> 00:24:21,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let him go!</font>

237
00:24:21,890 --> 00:24:24,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let him go, now!</font>

238
00:24:24,460 --> 00:24:27,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't want to win this way!</font>

239
00:24:27,220 --> 00:24:29,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Master?</font>

240
00:24:29,520 --> 00:24:32,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fool! Who cares about the match?!</font>

241
00:24:32,090 --> 00:24:34,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just kill that brat!</font>

242
00:24:38,530 --> 00:24:41,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's an order! Kill him!</font>

243
00:24:49,830 --> 00:24:52,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tenshinhan!</font>

244
00:24:52,170 --> 00:24:53,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stop it!</font>

245
00:25:00,660 --> 00:25:04,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What are you...</font>

246
00:25:05,380 --> 00:25:08,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son is back on his feet!</font>

247
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:10,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What could this mean?!</font>

248
00:25:14,520 --> 00:25:16,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You jerk!</font>

249
00:25:20,360 --> 00:25:22,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait, Goku!</font>

250
00:25:24,860 --> 00:25:30,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tenshinhan! How dare you
defy me, your own master?!</font>

251
00:25:30,870 --> 00:25:36,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I simply wish to fight at
full strength in this match.</font>

252
00:25:36,370 --> 00:25:38,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't require any help!</font>

253
00:25:38,380 --> 00:25:40,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will win using my own skills!</font>

254
00:25:40,780 --> 00:25:43,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I ordered you to kill him!</font>

255
00:25:43,110 --> 00:25:45,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I cannot!</font>

256
00:25:45,050 --> 00:25:49,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If I kill him, I will lose the
title of tournament champion.</font>

257
00:25:49,050 --> 00:25:51,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who cares about the title?!</font>

258
00:25:51,460 --> 00:25:55,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wasn't your dream to become
an assassin like Tao Pai Pai?!</font>

259
00:25:55,890 --> 00:25:57,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And besides...</font>

260
00:25:57,560 --> 00:26:02,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...I no longer want to be an assassin!</font>

261
00:26:07,100 --> 00:26:09,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What did you say?!</font>

262
00:26:09,570 --> 00:26:11,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That dumb Turtle Hermit</font>

263
00:26:11,810 --> 00:26:15,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">filled you with weird thoughts, didn't he?!</font>

264
00:26:15,350 --> 00:26:18,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Um... We're in the middle of a match...</font>

265
00:26:18,750 --> 00:26:20,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Silence!
- Y-Yes!</font>

266
00:26:20,680 --> 00:26:22,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Have you forgotten your debt to me</font>

267
00:26:22,820 --> 00:26:26,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">for making you the expert that you are?!</font>

268
00:26:26,260 --> 00:26:30,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn you! I'll just have
to kill you both myself!</font>

269
00:26:30,330 --> 00:26:35,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Chaozu! Stop them both from moving!</font>

270
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:37,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Chaozu!</font>

271
00:26:37,030 --> 00:26:40,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is the first time
Ten-<i>san</i> is fighting hard!</font>

272
00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:44,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I want to watch until the fight is over!</font>

273
00:26:48,450 --> 00:26:51,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You too, huh?!</font>

274
00:26:52,020 --> 00:26:57,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll kill everyone who defies me!</font>

275
00:27:00,520 --> 00:27:03,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Chaozu!
- Out of the way!</font>

276
00:27:25,020 --> 00:27:27,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Crane Hermit-<i>sama</i>!
- You needn't worry!</font>

277
00:27:30,020 --> 00:27:34,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's not the kind to die so easily.</font>

278
00:27:36,530 --> 00:27:39,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now the nuisance is gone!</font>

279
00:27:39,030 --> 00:27:41,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now you can fight without reserve!</font>

280
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:45,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry! It looks like I misunderstood!</font>

281
00:27:48,370 --> 00:27:55,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have no clue what is happening now...</font>

282
00:27:56,080 --> 00:27:59,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've betrayed my master...</font>

283
00:27:59,580 --> 00:28:02,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This match is all I have left.</font>

284
00:28:02,790 --> 00:28:07,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But now I feel like a weight has
been lifted off my shoulders...</font>

285
00:28:07,890 --> 00:28:12,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Cranes, turtles, revenge...
none of it matters!</font>

286
00:28:12,900 --> 00:28:17,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I can devote myself
entirely to defeating you!</font>

287
00:28:19,900 --> 00:28:23,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It sounds like you've become
a little better of a person now!</font>

288
00:28:25,940 --> 00:28:27,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh?</font>

289
00:28:27,980 --> 00:28:29,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Prepare yourself!</font>

290
00:28:29,750 --> 00:28:35,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">After what's happened,
I absolutely cannot lose this match!</font>

291
00:28:35,420 --> 00:28:37,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Me neither!</font>

292
00:28:37,220 --> 00:28:40,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, Goku! Now the real fight begins!</font>

293
00:28:40,220 --> 00:28:43,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will unquestionably finish
the match with my next attack!</font>

294
00:28:45,760 --> 00:28:50,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're not seriously planning
to use that technique, are you?!</font>

295
00:29:07,220 --> 00:29:08,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's this?!</font>

296
00:29:08,380 --> 00:29:14,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What could this be?!
Tenshinhan seems to be in pain!</font>

297
00:29:26,770 --> 00:29:30,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't think he's trying
to avoid a bathroom break...</font>

298
00:29:36,550 --> 00:29:38,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No! It isn't the <i>Kikouhou</i>!</font>

299
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's the <i>Shiyou-ken</i>!
["Four-Arm Technique"]</font>

300
00:30:08,140 --> 00:30:09,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No way!</font>

301
00:30:09,810 --> 00:30:11,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His arms!</font>

302
00:30:17,820 --> 00:30:20,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The incredible Shiyou-ken.</i></font>

303
00:30:20,160 --> 00:30:26,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Just how will the four-armed</i>
<i>Tenshinhan and Goku fight?!</i></font>

304
00:30:51,320 --> 00:30:54,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

305
00:30:51,320 --> 00:30:54,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

306
00:30:54,190 --> 00:30:56,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

307
00:30:54,190 --> 00:30:56,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

308
00:30:56,830 --> 00:31:03,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

309
00:30:56,830 --> 00:31:03,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

310
00:31:03,370 --> 00:31:06,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

311
00:31:03,370 --> 00:31:06,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

312
00:31:06,400 --> 00:31:08,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

313
00:31:06,400 --> 00:31:08,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

314
00:31:08,870 --> 00:31:14,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

315
00:31:08,870 --> 00:31:14,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Everyone is itching to go!</i></font>

316
00:31:14,910 --> 00:31:20,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

317
00:31:14,910 --> 00:31:20,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you act like an adult and give up</i></font>

318
00:31:20,880 --> 00:31:27,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

319
00:31:20,880 --> 00:31:27,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>You'll never unravel the mystery of the miracle!</i></font>

320
00:31:27,060 --> 00:31:38,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

321
00:31:27,060 --> 00:31:38,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Go on and try to live</i>
<i>even more wild and strong!</i></font>

322
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:45,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

323
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:45,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

324
00:31:45,740 --> 00:31:50,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Honto no yuki misete kuretara</i></font>

325
00:31:45,740 --> 00:31:50,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you will show me your true courage</i></font>

326
00:31:50,250 --> 00:31:57,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

327
00:31:50,250 --> 00:31:57,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

328
00:31:57,650 --> 00:32:06,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Tokimeku mune ni</i>
<i>kira-kira hikatta yume o ageru yo</i></font>

329
00:31:57,650 --> 00:32:06,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give your pounding heart</i>
<i>a glittery, shining dream!</i></font>

